    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "body": "`generated_jit` is deprecated, because `@overload` is a better solution - can you rewrite `nan_of_type` using `@overload` instead (see https://numba.readthedocs.io/en/latest/extending/high-level.html#high-level-extending)? For this to work with CUDA you will need the 0.57RC: https://numba.discourse.group/t/ann-numba-0-57-0rc1-and-llvmlite-0-40-0rc1/1879",
