    "body": "I'm also thinking perhaps you're wanting something more generic, like:\r\n\r\n```python\r\nfrom numba import cuda, types\r\nfrom numba.core.extending import overload\r\nimport numpy as np\r\n\r\n\r\ndef grid_position_like(index):\r\n    pass\r\n\r\n\r\n@overload(grid_position_like)\r\ndef grid_position_like_ol(index):\r\n    if isinstance(index, types.NumberClass):\r\n        dtype = index.dtype\r\n        def grid_position_like(index):\r\n            i_x, i_y = cuda.grid(2)\r\n            return (dtype(i_x), dtype(i_y))\r\n        return grid_position_like\r\n\r\n\r\n@cuda.jit\r\ndef f():\r\n    grid_position_like(np.int16)\r\n    grid_position_like(np.int32)\r\n    grid_position_like(np.int64)\r\n\r\n\r\nf[1, 1]()\r\ncuda.synchronize()\r\n```\r\n\r\nHere I can't print out the dtype because only strings and numbers are supported for printing on CUDA, but dumping the typing shows that the typings are as expected:\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ NUMBA_DUMP_ANNOTATION=1 python repro2.py\r\n\r\n...\r\n\r\n================================================================================\r\n-----------------------------------ANNOTATION-----------------------------------\r\n# File: /home/gmarkall/numbadev/issues/8891/repro2.py\r\n# --- LINE 20 --- \r\n# label 0\r\n\r\n@cuda.jit\r\n\r\n# --- LINE 21 --- \r\n\r\ndef f():\r\n\r\n    # --- LINE 22 --- \r\n    #   $2load_global.0 = global(grid_position_like: <function grid_position_like at 0x7f1ee4843010>)  :: Function(<function grid_position_like at 0x7f1ee4843010>)\r\n    #   $4load_global.1 = global(np: <module 'numpy' from '/home/gmarkall/mambaforge/envs/numballvm14/lib/python3.10/site-packages/numpy/__init__.py'>)  :: Module(<module 'numpy' from '/home/gmarkall/mambaforge/envs/numballvm14/lib/python3.10/site-packages/numpy/__init__.py'>)\r\n    #   $6load_attr.2 = getattr(value=$4load_global.1, attr=int16)  :: class(int16)\r\n    #   del $4load_global.1\r\n    #   $8call_function.3 = call $2load_global.0($6load_attr.2, func=$2load_global.0, args=[Var($6load_attr.2, repro2.py:22)], kws=(), vararg=None, varkwarg=None, target=None)  :: (class(int16),) -> UniTuple(int16 x 2)\r\n    #   del $8call_function.3\r\n    #   del $6load_attr.2\r\n    #   del $2load_global.0\r\n\r\n    grid_position_like(np.int16)\r\n\r\n    # --- LINE 23 --- \r\n    #   $12load_global.4 = global(grid_position_like: <function grid_position_like at 0x7f1ee4843010>)  :: Function(<function grid_position_like at 0x7f1ee4843010>)\r\n    #   $14load_global.5 = global(np: <module 'numpy' from '/home/gmarkall/mambaforge/envs/numballvm14/lib/python3.10/site-packages/numpy/__init__.py'>)  :: Module(<module 'numpy' from '/home/gmarkall/mambaforge/envs/numballvm14/lib/python3.10/site-packages/numpy/__init__.py'>)\r\n    #   $16load_attr.6 = getattr(value=$14load_global.5, attr=int32)  :: class(int32)\r\n    #   del $14load_global.5\r\n    #   $18call_function.7 = call $12load_global.4($16load_attr.6, func=$12load_global.4, args=[Var($16load_attr.6, repro2.py:23)], kws=(), vararg=None, varkwarg=None, target=None)  :: (class(int32),) -> UniTuple(int32 x 2)\r\n    #   del $18call_function.7\r\n    #   del $16load_attr.6\r\n    #   del $12load_global.4\r\n\r\n    grid_position_like(np.int32)\r\n\r\n    # --- LINE 24 --- \r\n    #   $22load_global.8 = global(grid_position_like: <function grid_position_like at 0x7f1ee4843010>)  :: Function(<function grid_position_like at 0x7f1ee4843010>)\r\n    #   $24load_global.9 = global(np: <module 'numpy' from '/home/gmarkall/mambaforge/envs/numballvm14/lib/python3.10/site-packages/numpy/__init__.py'>)  :: Module(<module 'numpy' from '/home/gmarkall/mambaforge/envs/numballvm14/lib/python3.10/site-packages/numpy/__init__.py'>)\r\n    #   $26load_attr.10 = getattr(value=$24load_global.9, attr=int64)  :: class(int64)\r\n    #   del $24load_global.9\r\n    #   $28call_function.11 = call $22load_global.8($26load_attr.10, func=$22load_global.8, args=[Var($26load_attr.10, repro2.py:24)], kws=(), vararg=None, varkwarg=None, target=None)  :: (class(int64),) -> UniTuple(int64 x 2)\r\n    #   del $28call_function.11\r\n    #   del $26load_attr.10\r\n    #   del $22load_global.8\r\n    #   $const32.12 = const(NoneType, None)  :: none\r\n    #   $34return_value.13 = cast(value=$const32.12)  :: none\r\n    #   del $const32.12\r\n    #   return $34return_value.13\r\n\r\n    grid_position_like(np.int64)\r\n\r\n\r\n================================================================================\r\n```\r\n\r\nnoting the typings:\r\n\r\n```\r\n$8call_function.3 = ... :: (class(int16),) -> UniTuple(int16 x 2)\r\n$18call_function.7 = ... :: (class(int32),) -> UniTuple(int32 x 2)\r\n$28call_function.11 = ... :: (class(int64),) -> UniTuple(int64 x 2)\r\n```",
